  "body": "cc @takenspc \r\n\r\nThe /link-fixup.js file is included in all multipage pages. It's about 2.8MB (edit: though it's gzipped, so ~0.5MB), so can take a while to download and compile. It contains the same thing as /multipage/fragment-links.json.\r\n\r\nWas there a particular reason to have the data in the link-fixup.js file directly, rather than XHR-ing the JSON file only when it is needed?",
